---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-07-08';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of use for singletenant.ai: what the data is, what it is not, and the limits of our liability."
>
  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="m-0 mb-2" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        Terms of use
      </h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-10" style="color: var(--color-mute);">
        Last updated {LAST_UPDATED}
      </p>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What this site is</h2>
        <p>
          singletenant.ai publishes reference data about dedicated and
          single-tenant LLM hosting vendors. The data is provided for
          general information. It is not legal, procurement, security, or
          compliance advice, and it is not a recommendation to buy from any
          vendor.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy and verification</h2>
        <p>
          Every populated fact links to the primary source it was checked
          against and shows the date of that check. Vendor pricing,
          certifications, and terms change; a fact is accurate as of its
          verified date, not necessarily today. Facts we could not verify
          are shown as "Not verified". Verify any fact with the vendor
          before relying on it in a procurement or compliance decision. The
          <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a> explains how data is
          gathered and how to submit a correction.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party sites</h2>
        <p>
          Outbound links lead to sites we do not control and are not
          responsible for. Some are referral links, marked where they
          appear and explained on the
          <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Use of the content</h2>
        <p>
          Site content is © singletenant.ai. You may quote the data with
          attribution and a link to the page it came from. Bulk
          reproduction of the database requires permission:
          <a href="mailto:editor@singletenant.ai">editor@singletenant.ai</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by law, we accept no liability for loss
          arising from reliance on the information on this site. Nothing in
          these terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded under the
          law of England and Wales, which governs these terms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
